`,i.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Submit the post and open its preview or published page in a browser that uses the PDFObject rendering path. On a vulnerable installation, the document URL is interpolated into generated markup and the ",i.jsx(t.code,{children:"onload"})," handler executes. The alert demonstrates JavaScript execution in the origin of the WordPress site."]}),`
`,i.jsx(t.h2,{id:"impact",children:"Impact"}),`
`,i.jsx(t.p,{children:"Successful exploitation runs attacker-controlled JavaScript in the context of the affected WordPress site. The script can interact with the page as the viewing user, access data available to that browser session, or perform actions permitted by the victim's WordPress privileges."}),`
