`,i.jsx(t.p,{children:"On a vulnerable installation, the request succeeds even though the contributor cannot edit or delete the target Media Library attachment. The response contains the rendered image row and its deletion nonce. Submitting that nonce to the deletion action removes the attachment from the listing and can permanently delete it when no other directory listing references it."}),`
`,i.jsx(t.h2,{id:"impact",children:"Impact"}),`
`,i.jsx(t.p,{children:"A low-privileged authenticated user can manipulate Media Library attachments they do not own by associating them with a directory listing under their control. The follow-on deletion flow can permanently remove an attachment, affecting content integrity and availability."}),`
